down C › Pallet zone › P-1</td><td class="n">30</td><td class="n">31</td><td class="n">1</td><td class="n">₹390</td><td>Excess</td><td></td></tr></table>
<h2>Annexure C — Items found at a different location</h2><table class="t" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><tr><th>Item</th><th>As per register</th><th>Found at</th><th>Qty</th></tr><tr><td>Tower Bolt 8 inch</td><td>Showroom Block › Ground Floor › Showroom › R-05 › Bin 14</td><td>Showroom Block › Ground Floor › Showroom › R-07 › Bin 2</td><td class="n">350</td></tr><tr><td>Stretch Film Roll</td><td>Main Warehouse › First Floor › Godown D › R-03 › S-2</td><td>Main Warehouse › First Floor › Godown B › R-04 › S-1</td><td class="n">70</td></tr></table>
